R5  4D equations on s(X) (n general, then n = 4).  sigma := cV * (s_Y - R/cH) on s(X).
    (P) projection: s*(G^Y) = G(g) + Lambda_P g      (horizontal block of the Einstein tensor of g_aleph)
    (A) reduced action  S[g] = int_X s*(s_Y) dvol(s* g_aleph) = cH^(n/2) int (R/cH + sigma/cV) dvol_g
        => Euler-Lagrange: G(g) + Lambda_A g = 0,   Lambda_A = -cH sigma / (2 cV).
